{"q":"459","t":"Repeated Substring Pattern","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, check if it can be constructed by taking a substring of it and appending multiple copies of the substring together.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;abab&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> It is the substring &quot;ab&quot; twice.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;aba&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;abcabcabcabc&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> It is the substring &quot;abc&quot; four times or the substring &quot;abcabc&quot; twice.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists of lowercase English letters.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"repeatedSubstringPattern\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"s\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"String Matching","slug":"string-matching"},{"name":"Z Algorithm","slug":"z-algorithm"},{"name":"Knuth–Morris–Pratt Algorithm","slug":"knuth-morris-pratt-algorithm"}],"s":[{"t":"Find the Index of the First Occurrence in a String","s":"find-the-index-of-the-first-occurrence-in-a-string","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Repeated String Match","s":"repeated-string-match","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Myntra","myntra"]],"cs":{"a":[],"b":[["Google","google",4]],"m":[["Amazon","amazon",11],["Meta","facebook",5],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",5],["Microsoft","microsoft",4],["Myntra","myntra",3],["tcs","tcs",2],["eBay","ebay",2],["Grab","grab",2]]}}